export anchor FrostedGlassStyle:
    number: 8
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Frosted glass
    idea: Light airy panels of frosted glass floating over a soft pastel haze, with thin white edges, light type weights and plenty of breathing room.
    base: light
    palette:
        haze: #eef0fb, the page base under a linear gradient from #fdf1f6 to #eef0fb to #ecf8f5
        roseGlow: #f9c9df, a radial blob at the top left
        periwinkleGlow: #c4d0ff, a radial blob at the top right
        aquaGlow: #bdeee0, a radial blob at the lower right
        lavenderGlow: #e3d2ff, a radial blob at the lower left
        glass: #ffffff, panels at 55 percent with a 22px blur, or 88 percent where blur is not supported
        edge: #ffffff, 1px panel borders at 85 percent and a 1px inner top highlight
        ink: #1f2340, text and headings
        slate: #4a4f6e, meta text, labels and axis text
        violet: #5b4bd6, the primary button, progress rings, this week's line and the focus ring
        violetDeep: #4636b8, links
        green: #0f6b4f, the On track status
        amber: #8a4a00, the At risk status
        raspberry: #b42347, the Behind status, its ring and the overdue fact
    type:
        Text in Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI, system-ui, SF Pro Text,
        Helvetica Neue, Roboto, sans-serif, and display in Segoe UI
        Variable Display, SF Pro Display, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif.
        Sizes are a 52px weight 300 greeting, 54px weight 200 summary
        figures with tabular numerals, 22px weight 400 section titles,
        16px weight 500 project names, 15px body at 1.55 and 13px meta and
        pills.
    layout:
        A floating glass pill top bar with the brand, search, a round
        bell, the user and New project. A centred hero gives the date, the
        greeting and one line on the overdue tasks, then the nav as a
        centred glass segmented control. Four glass summary panels follow
        in a row. Below, a grid puts the projects panel on the left, as
        rows with a progress ring, name, meta and status pill, and stacks
        the chart and activity panels on the right. Below 1000px the board
        stacks and the summary becomes two by two, and below 640px the
        search takes a full row and New project shrinks to its icon.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between panels, 24px inside panels and 56px above the greeting.
    density: Airy. Few panels and a centred hero, about one screen for the whole dashboard.
    corners: 24px panels, 18px rows, 32px on the style sheet, and fully round pills, buttons, nav and search.
    borders: 1px white at 85 percent on every panel plus a 1px inner top highlight.
    shadows: Soft and wide, 0 10px 40px in rgba(60,50,140,0.10). The violet button glows with 0 6px 20px at 35 percent.
    icons:
        Thin rounded line icons at 18px with a 1.4 stroke. Status pills
        show a circle with a tick for On track, a diamond with a bang for
        At risk and a rounded square with a down arrow for Behind.
        Progress is a 56px ring with the percent inside. The chart is a
        dashed grey line for last week and a solid violet line with a soft
        area and dots for this week. Activity is a thin timeline with
        hollow dots.
    focus: A 2px violet outline offset 3px plus a 6px soft violet halo. A focused field gets a violet border, a 4px soft ring and a white fill.
    tone: Calm and reassuring in sentence case, such as A calm week overall and worth a look first.
